{"version":1,"content":"<p>今午（29日）1時許，赤柱舂磡角道42號紫荊園一獨立屋戶主報案，指發現兩件珠寶首飾不翼而飛，警方到場調查，列作盜竊案。</p><p>據悉，珠寶首飾總值約1000萬美元，不排除與女傭有關。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:21:53.334662+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:34:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T09:38:13.916833+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T08:18:17.564068+00:00","content_hash":"59bd22db36431d1556cd202edb439fbe26b07c755193ee71b36bf504410879a6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}